Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.85,0:00:17.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(教学中)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.47,0:00:30.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这边会常出题喔\N要注意
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.34,0:00:32.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,时间到了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.40,0:00:34.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,之后要预习喔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.54,0:00:35.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天到这边
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.41,0:00:37.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,起立
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.88,0:00:40.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,敬礼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.49,0:00:48.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.82,0:00:50.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小孩子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.76,0:00:52.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.06,0:01:24.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.46,0:01:29.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,铃木 你看这种书啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.46,0:01:31.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.06,0:01:33.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的很厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.53,0:01:37.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是图书馆借的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.67,0:01:39.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师也常去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.07,0:01:43.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下次去图书馆\N介绍点书给我看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.41,0:01:48.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师 我先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.28,0:01:54.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回家小心点喔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.23,0:02:13.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我无法看着对方的眼睛\N面对面聊天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.77,0:02:17.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对我来说 书本才是我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.11,0:02:24.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然可以看者对方
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.72,0:02:28.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我不知道怎样与人来往
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.32,0:02:31.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以交不到朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.59,0:02:37.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,图书馆对我来h\N是个治愈的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.33,0:02:42.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在那边竟然发生这种事情
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.01,0:03:04.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让人怀孕的图书馆色狼\N无法出声 被内射的女高中生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.78,0:05:39.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天也来了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.85,0:05:48.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看书吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.39,0:05:57.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看不一样的书耶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.63,0:06:34.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在图书馆内 不要发出声音
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.40,0:07:12.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不懂的地方\N可以问我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.14,0:07:17.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.30,0:07:40.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请住手\N不要说话
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.13,0:08:18.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请住手
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.00,0:08:20.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,被被听见喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.02,0:09:41.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好像湿了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.20,0:11:32.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能大叫喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.02,0:11:54.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,被听见的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.15,0:11:57.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么办啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.43,0:12:11.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.98,0:12:24.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请住手
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.52,0:12:32.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.68,0:12:59.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来玩弄一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.50,0:14:20.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,兴奋了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.71,0:14:31.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好湿喔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.79,0:14:42.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让老师看小穴吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.79,0:14:46.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.36,0:15:21.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老实一点喔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.27,0:16:09.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好爽喔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.52,0:17:00.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这边想要的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.62,0:17:32.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都这么兴奋了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.03,0:17:39.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.08,0:18:30.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是开端
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.49,0:18:42.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为这样我就五天不上学
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.76,0:18:47.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是这样下去不行\N我就下定决心 上学了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.77,0:18:52.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.37,0:18:54.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道阿
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.04,0:18:58.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能说出去喔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.98,0:19:00.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个老师 私底下很色喔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.85,0:19:03.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大冢都知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.31,0:19:06.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们不知道吗\N看起来很正常的老师
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.52,0:19:10.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样很糟糕喔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.89,0:19:50.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也来了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.96,0:19:53.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也是想要吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.84,0:20:00.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.37,0:20:05.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要这样了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.51,0:20:08.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这次不一样喔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.18,0:20:16.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天我会让你很爽喔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.32,0:20:20.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是老师和学生
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.13,0:20:25.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.67,0:20:29.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,住手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.42,0:20:51.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看这边喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.31,0:21:15.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的请住手
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.71,0:21:18.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这老实的表情
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.27,0:21:43.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要吵喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.14,0:21:48.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样很兴奋吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.29,0:21:58.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是巨乳喔
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.54,0:22:50.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,找什么书啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.88,0:22:59.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个很有趣喔
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.55,0:23:03.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有看过吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.29,0:23:11.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,舌头伸出来
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.75,0:24:08.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又湿了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.56,0:24:14.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很喜欢吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.30,0:24:24.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都湿了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.51,0:24:33.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好湿喔
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.98,0:24:39.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,超湿喔\N不要叫
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.59,0:24:52.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摸看看
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.67,0:25:00.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是老师喔
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.23,0:25:28.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很漂亮的小穴喔
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.44,0:25:39.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摸啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.59,0:25:58.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.68,0:26:18.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会讨厌吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.42,0:26:28.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,舔啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.23,0:26:33.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会讨厌吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.84,0:26:42.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,舔啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.25,0:26:55.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.00,0:27:06.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很大吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.53,0:27:11.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,舌头伸出来
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.81,0:27:18.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.28,0:27:21.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,舔啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.23,0:27:40.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.17,0:27:43.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吃吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.17,0:27:47.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,舌头伸出来
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.24,0:27:54.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伸出来
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.05,0:28:00.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么味道
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.79,0:28:04.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吃吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.59,0:28:09.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,含深一点喔
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.40,0:28:22.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看这边啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.41,0:28:25.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要啊\N吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.34,0:28:27.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看这边
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.62,0:28:33.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,深一点喔
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.93,0:29:25.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想要吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.21,0:29:30.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想要吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.35,0:29:38.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这本书不错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.40,0:30:31.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,住手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.74,0:30:37.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,继续看书啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.59,0:31:28.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,继续看书
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.54,0:31:41.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爽吗
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.81,0:31:49.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么阿
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.08,0:31:54.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爽吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.72,0:32:35.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看这边
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.79,0:32:38.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,深一点
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.81,0:32:53.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想要了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.68,0:32:54.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,站好
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.88,0:32:59.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还想要吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.47,0:33:56.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么阿
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.39,0:34:46.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喜欢这样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.32,0:35:51.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我看看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.92,0:35:54.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哪边喜欢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.19,0:35:59.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哪边 喜欢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.47,0:36:10.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那边有趣吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.45,0:38:06.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好湿喔
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.80,0:38:19.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还要吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.47,0:38:26.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,住手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.38,0:39:00.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,脚张开阿
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.82,0:39:44.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.95,0:39:47.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对这种工作有兴趣吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.93,0:40:29.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,安静一点喔
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.80,0:40:35.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.74,0:40:38.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又去了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.83,0:41:04.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,仔细看看喔
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.03,0:41:07.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哪时候考试啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.04,0:41:11.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,书上没媛
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.71,0:41:19.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这边
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.59,0:41:27.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这边会出题喔
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.55,0:41:52.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好湿喔
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.96,0:42:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,懂吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.97,0:42:13.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,应该会解题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.69,0:43:08.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过来一点
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.48,0:44:05.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喜欢这个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.49,0:44:11.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你拿手的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.64,0:44:36.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,受不了了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.80,0:44:57.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,受不了了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.48,0:45:10.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要去了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.15,0:45:13.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要这样
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.28,0:45:18.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要射喔\N超爽啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.35,0:45:20.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喜欢这样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.94,0:46:15.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,超爽吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.75,0:46:21.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,舔干净啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.47,0:47:13.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,之后过了一个月
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.74,0:47:16.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,害怕去图害馆
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.67,0:47:18.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我举足不前
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.88,0:47:20.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,已经不去了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.61,0:47:23.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我这样决定了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.97,0:47:51.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,己经过了还书的期限了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.91,0:47:56.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,内心已经封闭了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.11,0:47:59.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绝对是
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.45,0:48:07.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是今天的还书
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.86,0:48:10.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.80,0:48:21.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是铃木小姐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.54,0:48:24.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还书吗
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.07,0:48:27.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 晚还了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.14,0:48:32.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,先到柜台吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.56,0:48:51.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这本书 想借的人很多
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.43,0:48:53.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很伤脑筋喔
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.64,0:48:55.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.77,0:49:05.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人常在图昼馆做色情的事\N真伤脑筋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.85,0:49:11.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.85,0:49:17.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把图书馆当成宾馆了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.06,0:49:21.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很伤脑筋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.40,0:49:29.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,会这样做的人\N太奇怪了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.35,0:49:40.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请住手
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.07,0:50:39.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,叫阿
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.74,0:50:43.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请住手
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.35,0:50:51.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我看看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.29,0:50:58.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.83,0:51:00.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请住手
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.44,0:51:11.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我看看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.77,0:51:14.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我之前都盯着看喔
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.05,0:51:20.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,巨乳啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.00,0:51:34.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好可爱喔
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.07,0:51:38.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我看看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.40,0:51:41.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好可爱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.01,0:51:45.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不可以逃喔
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.74,0:51:49.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,被人看见怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.16,0:52:09.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.97,0:52:14.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.97,0:52:16.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尿尿吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.64,0:52:18.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是来尿尿的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.24,0:52:22.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尿啊
